  "title": "Hearty Ethiopian Rigatoni Berbere Stew",
  "description": "A tangy and chewy Ethiopian dish featuring rigatoni in a rich berbere stew, perfect for a cold winter's night, this wood-fired-bake inspired stew is dairy-free-friendly.",
